Subject: [PATCH v1 0/6] media: qcom: camss: add SC7180 (SM7125) support
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add SC7180/SM7125 camss support: CCI and CAMSS bindings, the VFE-170
based CAMSS_7180 version, CSIPHY D-PHY/C-PHY lane settings. Based on the
C-PHY series. NOTE: these commits currently lack Signed-off-by lines --
the author must add them before this series is sent.

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

